`include4/`, `services4/include/`, `services4/srvkm/{common,
bridged,devices/sgx,env/linux}`, `services4/system/intel_drm/`,
`services4/gburst/`. Provenance: 3.4 tree
`drivers/staging/intel_media/graphics/sgx/`.

Santos-OWNED (reviewable): `Makefile` (object list + golden PVRDEFS
from `bld/clovertrail/pvrdefs`), `Kconfig` hook (parent files),
